<title>USA: 3M Pharmaceuticals launching Aldara cream.</title>
<headline>3M Pharmaceuticals launching Aldara cream.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>3M Pharmaceuticals, a unit of Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co, said Tuesday that Aldara five percent cream will be available in pharmacies nationwide by June 9.</p>
<p>Aldara is a patient-applied treatment for genital and perianal warts.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
